  ($copy$quote.full-day-event-coverage.acknowledgements.permissions.label$copy$, $copy$Filming & Permissions$copy$),
  ($copy$quote.full-day-event-coverage.acknowledgements.permissions.detail$copy$, $copy$I confirm I have authority to arrange filming at the event and understand guests, participants and event activities may be captured. Where required, I am responsible for obtaining appropriate permissions from the venue, event organiser and participants.$copy$),
  ($copy$quote.full-day-event-coverage.acknowledgements.drone-rules.label$copy$, $copy$Drone Rules & Safety$copy$),
  ($copy$quote.full-day-event-coverage.acknowledgements.drone-rules.detail$copy$, $copy$I understand drone operations are subject to CASA regulations, airspace restrictions, crowds, weather, site conditions and the pilot’s safety assessment. These requirements may restrict or prevent some or all planned drone flights.$copy$),
  ($copy$quote.full-day-event-coverage.acknowledgements.coverage.label$copy$, $copy$Coverage & Deliverables$copy$),
  ($copy$quote.full-day-event-coverage.acknowledgements.coverage.detail$copy$, $copy$I understand Full Day Event Coverage captures selected moments throughout the event rather than continuous recording. The package includes up to 5 hours of coverage, up to three drone flights, three professionally edited social media reels and a catalogue of additional unedited footage. Specific people, moments or shots cannot be guaranteed unless agreed beforehand.$copy$),
  ($copy$quote.full-day-event-coverage.acknowledgements.changes.label$copy$, $copy$Weather, Changes & Cancellations$copy$),
  ($copy$quote.full-day-event-coverage.acknowledgements.changes.detail$copy$, $copy$I understand weather, lighting and event conditions may affect coverage or footage quality. A 20% deposit is required to confirm the booking and 48 hours’ notice is required for cancellation or rescheduling. Late cancellations may result in loss of the deposit. Where Gladstone Uncovered cannot safely or reasonably provide the service, rescheduling or a refund may be offered where appropriate.$copy$)
